sec('证据、口径与缺口',table(['数据源','可见行 / 发布','最后成功 UTC','覆盖状态'],[[H(x['resource']),str(x['visibleRows'])+' / '+str(x['published']),H(x['lastSuccessAt']),H(x['status'])+' / '+('完整' if x['complete'] else '不完整')] for x in sources if x['resource'] in ['settlements','orders','returns','inventory_age','inventory_events','reimbursements']])+table(['结算报告','本次行数','实际日期范围','币种'],[[x['reportId'],x['rows'],x['min']+' — '+x['max'],'缺失'] for x in e['reportAnalysis']])+'''<p>粒粒 MCP 授权范围：sellerAccountId bc6b9f51-fb75-408d-9ecd-4c5058bd39d7，marketplaceId ATVPDKIKX0DER；不混店 / 站点。报告日采用 Asia/Shanghai；结算按报表业务日，退货按 UTC 仓收日。多源日期语义不作同批订单解释。</p><p>分页 242 / 242、12,066 行 id 唯一，按 reportId + rowNumber 保留事实；没有因类似金额行擅自去重，完整业务指纹未发现跨报告重叠。库龄只取最新快照，退货只取单份报告。结算币种 null，没有借库龄 USD 补币种。</p><p>未分配店铺费用 876.68 包括超龄费 211.06、其他优惠券 / Deal / Vine 净费用 665.62，未强制摊 SKU。data_query 实际是分页表接口，未采用 Skill 旧 SQL 描述。未接入 finance / restock / reviews 执行器均如实留缺，不跳网页、不虚报执行。</p>'''+table(['Skill','服务端 SHA-256'],[[H(x['manifest']['skill_id']),'<code>'+H(x['manifest']['sha256'])+'</code>'] for x in e['skills']])+'''<p>同目录 evidence.json 保留逐行金额、reportId、rowNumber、请求编号、快照和 Skill 版本；sku-profit-partial.csv 为完整 71 个有销售 SKU 表，另见 build_report.py 和 validation.json。未加载根 .env、未启动任务 / Worker、迁移、部署或写入店铺；仅创建本地报告，无 commit / push / 服务器同步。</p><p><b>分析稿待确认：</b>是否认可先核对退款与高费用 SKU、再补齐仓储与索赔证据的顺序？确认不代表授权执行店铺变更。</p>''')
css='''*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f2f5fa;color:#22314a;font:15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang SC",sans-serif}main{max-width:1350px;margin:auto;padding:32px}header{padding:32px;background:#172843;color:white;border-radius:16px}header p:not(:first-child){border-left:3px solid #77aaff;padding-left:18px}h1{font-size:34px}h2{font-size:24px}section{margin:24px 0;padding:28px;background:white;border:1px solid #dce3ed;border-radius:14px}.scroll{overflow:auto}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px;margin:18px 0}th,td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e7f0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}th{background:#eaf0f9}tr:hover td{background:#f4f8ff}.warn{background:#fff1d5;border-left:4px solid #cc8a20;padding:14px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}input{padding:10px;border:1px solid #aebed5;border-radius:6px;width:320px}small{color:#687b93}@media print{main{padding:0}body{background:white}header{background:white;color:black}section{border:0;padding:12px 0}.scroll{overflow:visible}table{font-size:10px}input{display:none}}'''
